Recommends: cinnamon
Description: Desktop preset manager for Linux Mint Cinnamon
 Saves and restores full desktop "look" presets -- GTK theme, icon
 theme, cursor theme and size, wallpaper, panel layout and applets,
 extensions, desklets, and sound theme -- as one switchable snapshot,
 the way Windows XP handled visual styles.
 .
 Optionally also snapshots and restores the login screen (LightDM),
 boot splash (Plymouth), and bootloader (GRUB) config, each applied
 as its own separately-authorized action.
